From 0fe84e2f3b2407b8d4dcbdb51ac0fba0ddbfd3f5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tropicrainforest <tropicrainforest27017@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 18 Jun 2026 23:07:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/7] Remove unguarded enterprise-module headers from
 core_headers_library

The core_headers_library target in src/BUILD.bazel lists
//src/mongo/db/modules/enterprise/... header targets directly in its
hdrs list (an unconditional list, not a select()). The enterprise
module is absent from the community/public source tree, so these 89
labels are dangling references and Bazel analysis fails before any
compilation.
---
 src/BUILD.bazel | 89 -------------------------------------------------
 1 file changed, 89 deletions(-)

